Container Orchestration

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph App["Application Layer"]
        direction TB
        UI["User Interface System"]
        MOBILE["Mobile Service"]
        Admin["Admin Service"]
    end

    subgraph RAG["RAG Pipeline Layer"]
        direction TB
        Query["Query Service"]
        Chunking["Chunking"]
        Embeddings["Embeddings"]
        Retrieval["Retrieval"]
        Augment["Augment Service"]
        Generate["Generate"]
        Routing["Routing"]
        Caching["Caching"]
    end

    subgraph Data["Data Layer"]
        direction TB
        NoSQL["Vector DB"]
        Cache["Redis"]
        SQL["PostgreSQL"]
    end

    subgraph MONITOR["Monitoring Stack"]
        direction TB
        Grafana["Grafana"]
        Prometheus["Prometheus"]
        Jaeger["Jaeger"]
        PPD["Private Policy Document"]
    end

    Data --- MONITOR
    Data --- RAG
    App --- MONITOR
    App --- RAG
    RAG --- MONITOR

    classDef appStyle fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#4a90d9,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
